-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The LZH decoders (lib/src/codec/lzh) are ported from lhasa by Simon Howard
(https://github.com/fragglet/lhasa), ISC license. The LHA and ARJ encoders
follow the LZ77 parse of zlib deflate.c (notice above). The LHA handler
also uses the meaning of the comment and MS-DOS attribute extended headers
from libarchive archive_read_support_format_lha.c, Copyright (c) 2008-2014
Michihiro NAKAJIMA (BSD 2-clause, same terms as the libarchive notice
above).

Copyright (c) 2011-2025, Simon Howard

Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software
for any purpose with or without fee is hereby granted, provided
that the above copyright notice and this permission notice appear
in all copies.

