-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The RAR readers (lib/src/format/rar, lib/src/codec/rar) are ported from
libarchive archive_read_support_format_rar.c (Copyright (c) 2003-2007 Tim
Kientzle, Copyright (c) 2011 Andres Mejia) and
archive_read_support_format_rar5.c (Copyright (c) 2018 Grzegorz Antoniak),
under the BSD 2-clause license reproduced above for libarchive. No unRAR
code was used. The RAR5 writer is original code written from the RAR5
format definition. The length limited Huffman code builder in
rar_huffman.dart follows zlib trees.c (notice above).

BLAKE2s/BLAKE2sp (lib/src/crypto/blake2sp.dart) is ported from the BLAKE2
reference code, Copyright 2012 Samuel Neves, used under CC0 1.0 Universal.

PPMd var.I (lib/src/codec/ppmd8) and SHA-1 (lib/src/crypto/sha1.dart) are
ported from public domain C files of 7-Zip by Igor Pavlov (PPMd var.I
(2002) by Dmitry Shkarin, public domain).

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The RAR 2.0 decoder (lib/src/codec/rar/rar2_decoder.dart) and the RAR 3.x
key derivation and header decryption (lib/src/crypto/rar3_kdf.dart,
lib/src/format/rar) and the RAR 7 (compression version 1) decoding in
lib/src/codec/rar/rar5_decoder.dart are ported from rardecode
(https://github.com/nwaples/rardecode), BSD 2-clause license:

Copyright (c) 2015, Nicholas Waples
All rights reserved.

